name minidocument
category Package
revision 43752
shortdesc Creates miniature documents inside other LaTeX documents
relocated 1
longdesc This package can be used to create miniature documents inside
longdesc other LaTeX documents. Inside the minidocument all features of
longdesc the outer vertical mode like page breaking, floats, marginpars,
longdesc etc. are available.
